				},
				{
					"id": "tUE6mpJKYHmfJqLKu",
					"name": "Machine-Spirits Are Sorcery",
					"local_notes": "Lore: Reflexive unease around advanced technology, treated as witchcraft by tribal custom.\n\nDesign: Quirk (B9), roleplaying flag only.",
					"tags": [
