		{
			"id": "TXJIfJvLagbOWIDQY",
			"name": "Regiment: Cadian",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Cadia's entire culture was built around producing disciplined line infantry; \"Cadian Shock Troops\" are the Guard's iconic drilled regulars in Black Library fiction and codex background alike. Cadia fell in the 13th Black Crusade (999.M41), so surviving Cadian regiments are regiments without a homeworld who carry its memory.\n\nDesign: Net 0 points, per-regiment flavor lens (see this file's `notes`).",
			"tags": [
				"Imperium",
				"Astra Militarum"
			],
			"children": [
				{
					"id": "tWa3Mn6hQWi_pv03a",
					"name": "Cadian Drill",
					"local_notes": "Lore: Cadian training is famous for relentless, standardised drill.\n\nDesign: Perk (B9), +1 to Soldier.",
					"tags": [
						"Perk",
						"Imperium"
					],
					"base_points": 1,
					"features": [
