		{
			"id": "TXjVZYpRN9GRrhywK",
			"name": "Regiment: Catachan",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Catachan \"Jungle Fighters\" are raised on one of the galaxy's most lethal death worlds; codex background and Catachan-focused Imperial Armour and Black Library material play them as jungle-warfare specialists who look down on parade-ground soldiering.\n\nDesign: Net 0 points, per-regiment flavor lens (see this file's `notes`).",
