					]
				},
				{
					"id": "t0nqkJcJyDjvhM3ct",
					"name": "Contempt for Parade Ground Discipline",
					"local_notes": "Lore: Catachans are famously unimpressed by regiments that soldier by the book instead of by results.\n\nDesign: Quirk (B9), roleplaying flag only.",
					"tags": [
						"Quirk",
