		{
			"id": "TQB3GdcTCGW2UyqaB",
			"name": "Regiment: Death Korps of Krieg",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Krieg regiments are raised from a world still atoning, in its own telling, for a civil war against the Imperium; codex background and Forge World's Krieg material depict them as gas-masked, fatalistic siege specialists who expect to die and are, if anything, eager to.\n\nDesign: Net 0 points, per-regiment flavor lens (see this file's `notes`).",
