			"name": "Regiment: Valhallan",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Valhallan regiments (Ice Warriors) come from a frozen world and are played in codex background as tenacious, grimly cheerful cold-climate infantry, at their best in the snow and less happy elsewhere.\n\nDesign: Net 0 points, per-regiment flavor lens (see this file's `notes`).",
			"tags": [
