					"id": "tMvxKBaNufjTkHFs8",
					"name": "Resents Warm Postings",
					"local_notes": "Lore: The flip side of a cold-worlder's training is discomfort and short temper in heat and humidity; Valhallans are written as glad to see a frozen front and sour about a warm one.\n\nDesign: Quirk (B9), roleplaying flag only.",
					"tags": [
						"Quirk",
						"Imperium"
