			"local_notes": "Lore: Tallarn regiments come from a desert world and are depicted (codex background, Forge World's Tallarn Desert Raiders material) as mobile, mounted/motorised raiders skilled at desert warfare.\n\nDesign: Net 0 points, per-regiment flavor lens (see this file's `notes`).",
