			"name": "Regiment: Mordian",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Mordian Iron Guard are the Guard's parade-ground archetype: rigid drill, immaculate uniforms, standing and firing in the open rather than taking cover — codex background plays this as almost suicidal discipline.\n\nDesign: Net 0 points, per-regiment flavor lens (see this file's `notes`).",
