			"name": "Regiment: Vostroyan",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Vostroyan Firstborn regiments carry ornate heirloom lasguns, long- barrelled and family-maintained (ordinary lasgun damage, not a sniper's long-las), and a feudal honor culture; codex background emphasizes family lineages of service and elaborate uniforms. Vostroya is a forge world, so the Forge World Origin lens pairs well.\n\nDesign: Net 0 points, per-regiment flavor lens (see this file's `notes`).",
