			"name": "Regiment: Armageddon Steel Legion",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Steel Legion regiments come from a hive/industrial world that has fought three Ork Waaaghs! in its recorded history (the Armageddon campaigns are one of the most-covered Black Library war narratives); played as gas-masked, tank-supported mechanized infantry.\n\nDesign: Net 0 points, per-regiment flavor lens (see this file's `notes`).",
