			"name": "Regiment: Tanith (First-and-Only)",
			"local_notes": "Lore: The Tanith First-and-Only, the \"Ghosts\" of Dan Abnett's Gaunt's Ghosts series, are light infantry raised for stealth and woodcraft whose home world was destroyed the day they were raised — they are the single most detailed Guard regiment in Black Library fiction.\n\nDesign: Net 0 points, per-regiment flavor lens (see this file's `notes`).",
			"tags": [
				"Imperium",
				"Astra Militarum"
